---
import BaseLayout from '../components/layout/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  pageTitle="Privacy Policy | Pinellas Ice Co"
  metaDescription="How Pinellas Ice Co collects, uses, and shares information submitted through pinellasiceco.com."
>
  <section class="page-head">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="muted">Effective date: July 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="container narrow legal">
      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>
        When you submit a form on this site or call us, we collect what you
        provide: name, business name, phone number, email address, location,
        and the details of your request (for example, the symptoms your ice
        machine is showing, or the kind of machine you're looking for). Our
        forms also record which page you submitted from.
      </p>
      <p>
        We do not collect payment information through this website.
      </p>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>
        We use your information to respond to your request: to call or email
        you back, to prepare estimates, and to schedule and perform service.
      </p>

      <h2>Sharing with local service providers</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>Information you submit may be shared with local service
        providers in order to fulfill your request.</strong> For example, if
        your request calls for a technician, an installation crew, or
        equipment sourced through a local partner, we may pass along your
        contact details and the substance of your request so that the work
        can be done. Every form on this site carries the same notice: by
        submitting, you agree that we or a local service partner may contact
        you about your request.
      </p>
      <p>
        We do not sell your information to data brokers, and we do not share
        it for purposes unrelated to your request.
      </p>

      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>
        We keep request records as long as they're useful for serving you
        (service history matters for equipment) and as required by ordinary
        business record-keeping. Ask us to delete your information and we
        will, unless we're required to retain it.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
      <p>
        This site is a static website and sets no tracking cookies of its
        own. If we add analytics, this policy will be updated to say what and
        why.
      </p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>
        You can ask what we hold about you, ask us to correct it, or ask us
        to delete it: email
        <a href="mailto:service@pinellasiceco.com">service@pinellasiceco.com</a>
        or call <a href="tel:+17278556873">(727) 855-6873</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>
        If this policy changes, the new version will be posted here with an
        updated effective date.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal h2 { font-size: var(--text-xl); margin-top: var(--space-8); margin-bottom: var(--space-3); }
</style>
